Complete Data Engineering SQL Learning & Interview Practice Roadmap
I've organized the topics into 13 stages with 10 questions each — 130 SQL questions in total, arranged so that every stage builds on what you've already learned.

We'll use PostgreSQL throughout, and the questions will gradually move from basic SQL to real-world Data Engineering problems involving ETL pipelines, deduplication, incremental loading, and optimization.
